{"title":"MIE 2016/Day 1/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Day_1/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The following system has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> integer solutions. We can say that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4b03ed0218784e2a44c146af69dcb43a0e55f54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{cases}\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x}&gt;3\\\\\\\\x\\leq12\\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -33px\" width=\"114\" height=\"75\" />\n</p><p><br />\n(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3fcab1b2fcb409eda856956d0d11b1a5330ded3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq k\\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/547e5dd37a024136d990b0996d8829269c236c8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\leq k\\leq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(c) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/3/1437ae61a7e5566e0b4901710d132254e48e5cd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\leq k\\leq6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(d) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/504ac467036dda6dea24d2d3e43f47e018240e6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\leq k\\leq8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(e) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82681964dc24de82892ae5e51400219fb0c652b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\geq8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Day_1/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45dbc40a0b64aee62fc42c680ccf70eccb3e60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x}&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"136\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8c3181072972e2daed633e702f3271aa2143418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x}-\\frac{3x}{x}&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"182\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94d993fc5f0035f5b807a2696bcdfe55f6c51e26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2-5x-14}{x}&gt;0\\begin{cases}x^2-5x-14&gt;0\\\\x&gt;0\\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"287\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/f/56f952ce1d786fea04872a5237a8a69bc0f3e96c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left.\\begin{array}{l}x &gt; 0\\\\x &gt; 7\\\\x &lt; -2\\end{array}\\right\\}x\\in(-2,0)\\cup(7,+\\infty)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"264\" height=\"64\" />\n</p><p><br />\nAdding the other interval we get\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/b/23bb2f75ab9066704d2c292074978445adb1cd6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in(-2,0)\\cup(7,12]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is the number of integer solutions, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f2444faa6428da1ca9e40d6d0ecadb6498143f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Day_1/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018093746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 83/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2936/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15872:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018093746 and revision id 89615. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}